title: AxiDraw
type: text/vnd.tiddlywiki

A [[Pen Plotter]] from Evil Mad Scientist: it holds a pen and draws a vector file on paper. It draws from [[Inkscape]] through a plugin. [[Original product page|https://shop.evilmadscientist.com/846]].

Its software is [[open source under the GPL|https://github.com/evil-mad/axidraw]] (GPL-2.0).

Bantam Tools acquired Evil Mad Scientist in 2024 and the AxiDraw is discontinued. The successor, the [[NextDraw|https://bantamtools.com/products/bantam-tools-nextdraw-8511]], lists at $949, about double the [[$475|https://www.adafruit.com/product/3509]] the AxiDraw V3 cost, and Bantam's site calls its software proprietary.

Used in [[Pi-Top + AxiDraw = Libre Drawing Machine]].
